<div class="sec alt"><div class="wrap">
<div class="head"><span class="eyebrow rv">What we won't do</span><h2 class="split">Seven promises, in writing.</h2></div>
<ul class="wont">
<li class="rv">We won't ship agent-written code that no engineer has reviewed.</li>
<li class="rv">We won't sell you a rewrite you don't need.</li>
<li class="rv">We won't hide bad news until the next meeting.</li>
<li class="rv">We won't hold your code or your data hostage.</li>
<li class="rv">We won't put unsupervised junior engineers on your project.</li>
<li class="rv">We won't put a number on our website we can't show you how we measured.</li>
<li class="rv">We won't sell accessibility overlays or promise legal compliance.</li>
</ul>
</div></div>
